# Streamlit Page Conventions

## Page Structure
Every page exports `render()`, called by `app.py`. One session per render, wrapped safely:

```python
def render():
    st.title("Page Name")
    st.caption("One-line description")
    session = get_session()
    try:
        # ... queries and UI ...
    finally:
        session.close()
```

## Standardized Elements

Signal type icons (reuse this exact map):
```python
TYPE_ICONS = {
    "fundraising": "💰", "funding_completed": "✅",
    "hiring": "👤", "ai_initiative": "🤖",
    "cloud_spend": "☁️", "outgrowing": "📈",
}
```

Score colors: green (≥30), yellow (≥15), red (<15).

## Rules
- `.limit()` all display queries (12 signals, 15 rankings, 5 events)
- Truncate strings: `title[:200]`, `description[:300]`
- Gate AI calls behind `st.button` + `st.spinner`, never auto-run on load
- "No data" states use `st.info()` with instructions to populate
